#: src/menus/filters/python-fu.xml:8(title)
msgid "The <quote>Python-Fu</quote> Submenu"
msgstr "Undermenyn <quote>Python-Fu</quote>"

#: src/menus/filters/python-fu.xml:11(primary)
msgid "Python-Fu"
msgstr "Python-Fu"

#: src/menus/filters/python-fu.xml:15(para)
msgid "By default this submenu just contains the Python-Fu console."
msgstr "Som standard innehåller den här undermenyn bara Python-Fu-konsolen."

#. cf. plug-ins/pygimp/doc/pygimp.html
#: src/menus/filters/python-fu.xml:19(para)
msgid ""
"Python-Fu is a set of <link linkend=\"bibliography-online-"
"python\">Python</link> modules that act as a wrapper to "
"<emphasis>libgimp</emphasis> allowing the writing of plug-ins for "
"<acronym>GIMP</acronym>."
msgstr ""
"Python-Fu består av <link linkend=\"bibliography-online-"
"python\">Python</link>-moduler som ger ett gränssnitt till "
"<emphasis>libgimp</emphasis> och gör det möjligt att skriva insticksmoduler "
"för <acronym>GIMP</acronym>."

#: src/menus/filters/python-fu.xml:28(para)
msgid ""
"You can access this submenu from the main menu through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filters</guimenu><guisubmenu>Development</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Python-"
"Fu</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du hittar undermenyn i huvudmenyn under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filter</guimenu><guisubmenu>Utveckling</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Python-"
"Fu</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#: src/menus/filters/python-fu.xml:39(title)
#: src/menus/filters/python-fu.xml:58(title)
msgid "The Python-Fu Console"
msgstr "Python-Fu-konsolen"

#: src/menus/filters/python-fu.xml:40(para)
msgid ""
"The Python-Fu console is a dialog window running a <quote>Python "
"shell</quote> (a Python interpreter in interactive mode). This console is "
"set up to make use of the internal <acronym>GIMP</acronym> library routines "
"of <emphasis>libgimp</emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"Python-Fu-konsolen är en dialogruta med ett <quote>Python-skal</quote> (en "
"Python-tolk i interaktivt läge). Den använder de interna "
"biblioteksfunktionerna i <emphasis>libgimp</emphasis> för "
"<acronym>GIMP</acronym>."

#: src/menus/filters/python-fu.xml:46(para)
msgid ""
"You can use the Python-Fu console to interactively test Python commands."
msgstr ""
"Du kan använda Python-Fu-konsolen för att interaktivt testa Python-"
"kommandon."

#: src/menus/filters/python-fu.xml:49(para)
msgid ""
"The console consists of a large scrollable main window for input and output,"
" where you can type Python commands. When you type in a Python command and "
"then press the <keycap>Enter</keycap> key, the command is executed by the "
"Python interpreter. The command's output as well as its return value (and "
"its error message, if any) will be displayed in the main window."
msgstr ""
"Konsolen består av ett stort rullningsbart fönster för in- och utdata där du"
" kan skriva Python-kommandon. När du skriver ett kommando och trycker på "
"<keycap>Retur</keycap> kör Python-tolken det. Kommandots utdata, returvärde "
"och eventuella felmeddelande visas i fönstret."

#: src/menus/filters/python-fu.xml:67(title)
msgid "The Python-Fu Console Buttons"
msgstr "Python-Fu-konsolknapparna"

#: src/menus/filters/python-fu.xml:71(para)
msgid ""
"This command lets you save the content of the main window, that is the "
"Python-Fu console input and output (including the "
"<quote><code>&gt;&gt;&gt;</code></quote> prompt)."
msgstr ""
"Detta kommando låter dig spara innehållet i huvudfönstret, det vill säga in-"
" och utmatningen för Python-Fu-konsolen (inklusive "
"<quote><code>&gt;&gt;&gt;</code></quote>-prompten)."

#. TODO check: With or without image?
#: src/menus/filters/python-fu.xml:110(para)
msgid ""
"When clicked, the <link linkend=\"plug-in-dbbrowser\">procedure "
"browser</link> pops up, with an additional button "
"<guibutton>Apply</guibutton>."
msgstr ""
"När du klickar på knappen öppnas <link linkend=\"plug-in-"
"dbbrowser\">procedurbläddraren</link>, där det också finns en knapp för "
"<guibutton>Verkställ</guibutton>."

#: src/menus/filters/python-fu.xml:115(para)
msgid ""
"When you press this <guibutton>Apply</guibutton> button in the procedure "
"browser, a call to the selected procedure will be pasted into the console "
"window as a Python command:"
msgstr ""
"När du klickar på <guibutton>Verkställ</guibutton> i procedurbläddraren "
"klistras ett Python-anrop till den valda proceduren in i konsolen:"

#: src/menus/filters/python-fu.xml:126(para)
msgid "Applied <acronym>PDB</acronym> procedure"
msgstr "Tillämpad <acronym>PDB</acronym>-procedur"

#: src/menus/filters/python-fu.xml:129(para)
msgid ""
"Now you just have to replace the parameter names (here: "
"<quote>width</quote>, <quote>height</quote>, and <quote>type</quote>) with "
"actual values, e.g."
msgstr ""
"Ersätt sedan parameternamnen (här <quote>width</quote>, "
"<quote>height</quote> och <quote>type</quote>) med värden, till exempel:"

#. Don't wrap the following line (without testing)!
#: src/menus/filters/python-fu.xml:135(programlisting)
#, no-wrap
msgid "config.set_property('width', 400)"
msgstr "config.set_property('width', 400)"

#: src/menus/filters/python-fu.xml:136(programlisting)
#, no-wrap
msgid "config.set_property('height', 300)"
msgstr "config.set_property('height', 300)"

#: src/menus/filters/python-fu.xml:137(programlisting)
#, no-wrap
msgid "config.set_property('type', Gimp.ImageBaseType.RGB)"
msgstr "config.set_property('type', Gimp.ImageBaseType.RGB)"

#: src/menus/filters/python-fu.xml:138(para)
msgid "Then press <keycap>Enter</keycap> to execute the command."
msgstr "Tryck sedan på <keycap>Retur</keycap> för att köra kommandot."

#: src/menus/filters/python-fu.xml:141(para)
msgid ""
"You can (and should!) use the constants you find in the description of the "
"procedure's parameters, for example <quote>RGB-IMAGE</quote> or "
"<quote>OVERLAY-MODE</quote>. But note that you have to replace hyphens "
"(<quote>-</quote>) with underscores (<quote>_</quote>): "
"<code>RGB_IMAGE</code>, <code>OVERLAY_MODE</code>."
msgstr ""
"Du kan (och bör!) använda konstanterna du hittar i beskrivningen av "
"procedurens parametrar, till exempel <quote>RGB-IMAGE</quote> eller "
"<quote>OVERLAY-MODE</quote>. Men observera att du behöver ersätta "
"bindestreck (<quote>-</quote>) med understreck (<quote>_</quote>): "
"<code>RGB_IMAGE</code>, <code>OVERLAY_MODE</code>."

#. cf. plug-ins/pygimp/doc/pygimp.html
#: src/menus/filters/python-fu.xml:151(para)
msgid ""
"Python-Fu is not limited to just calling procedures from the <link "
"linkend=\"glossary-pdb\"><acronym>PDB</acronym></link> "
"(<acronym>GIMP</acronym> procedural database). To create a new image object "
"like in the example above, you can also type"
msgstr ""
"Python-Fu kan göra mer än att anropa procedurer i <link linkend=\"glossary-"
"pdb\"><acronym>PDB</acronym></link> (<acronym>GIMP</acronym>s "
"procedurdatabas). Du kan till exempel också skapa ett nytt bildobjekt genom "
"att skriva"

#: src/menus/filters/python-fu.xml:157(programlisting)
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"              image = gimp.Image(width, height, type)\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"              image = gimp.Image(width, height, type)\n"
"            "

#: src/menus/filters/python-fu.xml:160(para)
msgid ""
"(with actual values for <quote>width</quote>, <quote>height</quote>, and "
"<quote>type</quote>)."
msgstr ""
"(med värden för parametrarna <quote>width</quote>, <quote>height</quote> och"
" <quote>type</quote>)."

#: src/menus/filters/python-fu.xml:170(para)
msgid "Pressing this button closes the console."
msgstr "Klicka på knappen för att stänga konsolen."

#: src/menus/filters/introduction.xml:9(title)
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Översikt"

#: src/menus/filters/introduction.xml:12(secondary)
#: src/menus/filters/introduction.xml:15(primary)
msgid "Menu"
msgstr "Meny"

#: src/menus/filters/introduction.xml:21(tertiary)
msgid "Introduction to filters"
msgstr "Introduktion till filter"

#: src/menus/filters/introduction.xml:24(para)
msgid ""
"In this section, you will find help for commands in the "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filters</guimenu></menuchoice> menu."
msgstr ""
"I det här avsnittet finns hjälp om kommandona i menyn "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filter</guimenu></menuchoice>."

#: src/menus/filters/introduction.xml:31(title)
msgid "The Contents of the <quote>Filters</quote> Menu"
msgstr "Innehållet i <quote>Filter</quote>-menyn"

#: src/menus/filters/introduction.xml:55(title)
msgid "About <acronym>GIMP</acronym> Filters"
msgstr "Om <acronym>GIMP</acronym>-filter"

#: src/menus/filters/introduction.xml:56(para)
msgid ""
"In <acronym>GIMP</acronym> terminology, a <emphasis>filter</emphasis> is a "
"plug-in that modifies the appearance of an image, in most cases just the "
"active layer of the image. Not all of the entries in this menu meet that "
"definition, however; the word <quote>filter</quote> is often mis-used to "
"mean any plug-in, regardless of what it does. Indeed, some of the entries in"
" this menu do not modify images at all."
msgstr ""
"I <acronym>GIMP</acronym> är ett <emphasis>filter</emphasis> en "
"insticksmodul som ändrar en bilds utseende, oftast bara det aktiva lagret. "
"Alla objekt i den här menyn är dock inte filter. Ordet <quote>filter</quote>"
" används ibland felaktigt om alla insticksmoduler, oavsett vad de gör. Vissa"
" menyobjekt ändrar inte bilder alls."

#: src/menus/filters/introduction.xml:65(para)
msgid ""
"With the exception of the topmost items of the <guimenu>Filters</guimenu> "
"menu, all of the entries are provided by plug-ins. Each plug-in decides for "
"itself where it would like its menu entry to be placed. Therefore, the "
"appearance of this menu can be completely different for each user. In "
"practice, though, the appearance does not vary very much, because most plug-"
"ins come with <acronym>GIMP</acronym> when it is installed, and of course "
"they are always in the same places in the menu."
msgstr ""
"Med undantag för de översta objekten i menyn <guimenu>Filter</guimenu> "
"kommer alla menyobjekt från insticksmoduler. Varje insticksmodul väljer var "
"dess menyobjekt ska placeras. Därför kan menyn se helt olika ut för olika "
"användare. I praktiken skiljer sig utseendet oftast inte så mycket, eftersom"
" de flesta insticksmoduler följer med <acronym>GIMP</acronym> och alltid "
"ligger på samma plats i menyn."

#: src/menus/filters/introduction.xml:75(para)
msgid ""
"Plug-ins are not restricted to just the <guimenu>Filters</guimenu> menu: a "
"plug-in can place entries in any menu. Indeed, a number of "
"<acronym>GIMP</acronym>'s basic functions (for example, <guimenuitem>Semi-"
"flatten</guimenuitem> in the <guimenu>Layer</guimenu> menu) are implemented "
"by plug-ins. But the <guimenu>Filters</guimenu> menu is the default place "
"for a plug-in to place its menu entries."
msgstr ""
"Insticksmoduler är inte begränsade till menyn <guimenu>Filter</guimenu>: de "
"kan lägga till objekt i vilken meny som helst. Flera av "
"<acronym>GIMP</acronym>s grundfunktioner implementeras faktiskt av "
"insticksmoduler, till exempel <guimenuitem>Halvutplattning</guimenuitem> i "
"menyn <guimenu>Lager</guimenu>. Menyn <guimenu>Filter</guimenu> är dock "
"standardplatsen för insticksmodulers menyobjekt."

#: src/menus/filters/introduction.xml:84(para)
msgid ""
"For general information on plug-ins and how to use them, see the section on "
"<link linkend=\"gimp-concepts-plugins\">Plug-ins</link>. You can find "
"information on the filters that are provided with <acronym>GIMP</acronym> in"
" the <link linkend=\"filters\">Filters</link> chapter. For filters you "
"install yourself, please refer to the information which came with them."
msgstr ""
"Allmän information om insticksmoduler och hur du använder dem finns i "
"avsnittet <link linkend=\"gimp-concepts-plugins\">Insticksmoduler</link>. "
"Information om filtren som följer med <acronym>GIMP</acronym> finns i "
"kapitlet <link linkend=\"filters\">Filter</link>. Läs dokumentationen som "
"medföljer filter du installerar separat."

#: src/menus/filters/development.xml:6(title)
msgid "The <quote>Development</quote> Submenu"
msgstr "Undermenyn <quote>Utveckling</quote>"

#: src/menus/filters/development.xml:9(primary)
msgid "Menus"
msgstr "Menyer"

#: src/menus/filters/development.xml:11(tertiary)
msgid "Development"
msgstr "Utveckling"

#: src/menus/filters/development.xml:14(para)
msgid ""
"This submenu contains development related items. Useful when you are "
"developing plug-ins."
msgstr ""
"Denna undermeny innehåller utvecklingsrelaterade objekt. Användbart när du "
"utvecklar insticksmoduler."

#: src/menus/filters/development.xml:21(para)
msgid ""
"You can access this submenu from the main menu through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filters</guimenu><guisubmenu>Development</guisubmenu></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du kan komma åt denna undermeny från huvudmenyn genom "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filter</guimenu><guisubmenu>Utveckling</guisubmenu></menuchoice>."

#: src/menus/filters/development.xml:31(title)
msgid "Categories"
msgstr "Kategorier"

#: src/menus/filters/development.xml:40(para)
msgid ""
"<guisubmenu>Plug-In Examples</guisubmenu>: the commands in this submenu "
"start example plug-ins in several programming languages. They can be used as"
" a starting point when you want to develop your own plug-in."
msgstr ""
"<guisubmenu>Exempel på insticksmoduler</guisubmenu>: kommandona i denna "
"undermeny startar exempelinsticksmoduler i flera programspråk. De kan "
"användas som en startpunkt när du vill utveckla egna insticksmoduler."

#: src/menus/filters/development.xml:46(para)
msgid ""
"At the moment example plug-ins are available for C, Lua, Python, Vala, "
"Script-Fu (Scheme) and JavaScript. Note that JavaScript plug-ins are "
"currently not available on Windows."
msgstr ""
"För närvarande finns exempel på insticksmoduler i C, Lua, Python, Vala, "
"Script-Fu (Scheme) och JavaScript. Observera att JavaScript-insticksmoduler "
"för närvarande inte finns för Windows."

